<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P rates Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz bond AA+.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz bond AA+.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Monday that it had assigned an AA+ rating to Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz AG's 15 billion yen worth of 3.05 percent reverse dual currency yen/Australian dollar bonds due March 27, 2007.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said in a statement the outlook was stable.</p>
</text>
